  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 렌즈의 초점거리를 찾아볼겁니다!<br>고등학교 교과서에서는 센서를 활용하지는 않지만<br>저는 센서를 활용해서 찾아보려했습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07a7457c2f2bc22e7e02c8c0aec3d3a126ec9a84\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07a7457c2f2bc22e7e02c8c0aec3d3a126ec9a84\" data-origin-width=\"282\" data-origin-height=\"207\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c1edc25cd1f898e92df5fc41ff5158ce3123f34\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c1edc25cd1f898e92df5fc41ff5158ce3123f34\" data-origin-width=\"625\" data-origin-height=\"700\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">일단 아래와 같이 실험 테이블에서 <br>멀~리 직원 광원을 만들기 위해 <br>손전등에 검정 종이를 붙혀서 설치합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3d5a850c51db486f44b1c8cc4aa4f3a0c11d3b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3d5a850c51db486f44b1c8cc4aa4f3a0c11d3b6\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">초음파 센서가 렌즈와 거리를 측정을 더 잘되게 하기 위해, 종이판도 설치 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/baf6e96c98a4c10d23941becf3ed610c0ce812b4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/baf6e96c98a4c10d23941becf3ed610c0ce812b4\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">초음파 센서로는 빛이 닿는 부위부터 렌즈사이 거리<br>밝기 센서로는 빛이 모이는 부분에 빛의 세기를 측정합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a4b44277f2e148882602b07c89f5a06e365e5d8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a4b44277f2e148882602b07c89f5a06e365e5d8\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/971d15b5ab31861645bb37bdd1c0cbd9a4ac1dff\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/971d15b5ab31861645bb37bdd1c0cbd9a4ac1dff\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f8c0d3f0dcbc4693a487179fae0d87f6149ac087\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f8c0d3f0dcbc4693a487179fae0d87f6149ac087\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">전체적인 구조는 위와 같습니다!ㅎㅎ<br>과학실에 있는 스탠드와 클램프로 잘 만들 수 있겠죠?<br><br>그러면 아래와 같이, 거리에 따른 밝기를 측정할 수 있습니다! 우리가 일일히 빛이 여기가 가장 많이 모인건가..? 할 필요 없이, 센서가 초점 거리를 말해주는거죠!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af73ad6a9d4cb0b6edcf83445bd65b8a264a5769\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af73ad6a9d4cb0b6edcf83445bd65b8a264a5769\" data-origin-width=\"887\" data-origin-height=\"552\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">오! 렌즈 초점거리 35.53cm네요!! 찾았습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ebb702b15040f9293020d5fea198e62e607eb50\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ebb702b15040f9293020d5fea198e62e607eb50\" data-origin-width=\"875\" data-origin-height=\"535\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/FakxQ/dJMb9aKD9bn/cmsJJX7Ogotx74kgDEVOz1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/FakxQ/dJMb9aKD9bn/cmsJJX7Ogotx74kgDEVOz1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
